WEBVTT

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:13.970
When I open this door
Kono doa akereba atarashii sekai ga

00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:17.860
A brand new world is beginning
Ima hajimarunda

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:24.440
Even if there are painful things ahead
Tsurai koto ga aru toshitemo

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:30.840
I will show you that I can overcome them all
Kitto norikoetemiseru

00:00:32.190 --> 00:00:38.600
I'm starting to walk in a brand new world now
Atarashii sekai ni ima arukidashita soko ha

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:44.830
And I'm sure there are [Dreams] and [Hope] there
[Yume] ya [Kibou] ga aru kara

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:48.050
This feeling is making my heart beat so fast
Dokidoki suru kono kimochi

00:00:48.050 --> 00:00:51.180
And there's no one who can stop it
Darenimo tomerarenai

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:56.200
My heart is tightening and out of control
Kyun to hazumu kokoro

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:00.560
So start flapping your wings from here
Koko kara habataiteiku

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:03.610
And soar high up into the sky
Ano sora he to takaku

00:01:03.610 --> 00:01:09.580
Aiming for [Tomorrow] and [The Future] beyond
[Ashita] [Mirai] mezashite

00:01:09.580 --> 00:01:12.910
We will definitely grow bigger someday
Itsuka ookiku nareru to

00:01:12.910 --> 00:01:16.180
That's what I believed
Sou shinjiteiru no

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:21.340
That's why, just spread your wings
Dakara tsubasa wo hiroge

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:44.800
The Japanese Deltora Quest is brought to you in English by ToranSubs

00:01:47.850 --> 00:01:49.500
You idiot, calm down!

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:53.650
Barda!!

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:56.300
This can't be...

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.000
Where... are we?

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:27.340
My body...

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:30.400
What's going on?

00:02:32.300 --> 00:02:33.450
Barda...

00:02:40.100 --> 00:02:41.250
What does <i>he</i>  want?

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:47.100
Huh?

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.300
Thank god, you've saved us.

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:01.050
Hey Filli, don't you think this is nice?

00:03:01.750 --> 00:03:06.250
The sword? I have so many of them already, and it's not like you can use it, right?

00:03:06.250 --> 00:03:07.700
What are you talking about?

00:03:09.900 --> 00:03:13.150
Look, we were so lucky to have taken this path.

00:03:13.150 --> 00:03:16.300
There probably won't be anything left here by tomorrow.

00:03:16.300 --> 00:03:18.050
She's... a mugger?!

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:19.550
H-Hey wait!

00:03:19.550 --> 00:03:21.900
Look at this, Kree! It's my victory trophy.

00:03:23.550 --> 00:03:25.850
Stop! My mother...

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:29.300
What mother, exactly?

00:03:30.250 --> 00:03:31.800
Hey, listen to us!

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:34.530
Are you just going to leave us here?

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:38.200
I'll tell you just one thing out of pity.

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:41.200
You two were attacked by the 'Wenn'.

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:45.800
They brought you here as an offering to the monster 'Wennbar'.

00:03:46.250 --> 00:03:49.100
The Wennbar likes fresh meat so...

00:03:49.100 --> 00:03:50.350
Wennbar?

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:53.100
When the sun goes down, the Wennbar will arrive,

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:55.000
To eat you both.

00:04:01.250 --> 00:04:02.450
It's no use...

00:04:03.200 --> 00:04:05.270
We're in big trouble.

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.650
We have to get out of here soon!

00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:14.780
What mother...

00:04:19.600 --> 00:04:21.550
It's pretty nice, isn't it?

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:23.450
I've always wanted something like this.

00:04:23.850 --> 00:04:25.300
So soft...

00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:30.000
Mean tree... Let go of it!

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:33.100
Return the cloak...

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:35.300
Return the cloak...

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:42.050
Get out of my way!

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:44.800
What is this?!

00:04:57.000 --> 00:04:58.350
Jasmine...

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:00.600
Jasmine...

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:03.700
Lief and Barda...

00:05:03.700 --> 00:05:06.100
Those two aren't bad people.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:08.100
Do you intend to abandon them?

00:05:08.100 --> 00:05:10.250
Grandfather, what are you trying to say?

00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:12.300
Lief and Barda?

00:05:12.300 --> 00:05:15.790
The two people that the Wenn brought here.

00:05:16.200 --> 00:05:18.150
How do you know they're not evil?

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:19.600
Come here.

00:05:39.050 --> 00:05:42.000
Is this... that guy's mother?

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:43.550
That's correct.

00:05:43.550 --> 00:05:47.600
Lief's mother made it with love.

00:05:47.600 --> 00:05:49.000
You're kidding, right?!

00:05:49.000 --> 00:05:52.000
Grey Guards don't have mothers!

00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:53.750
Who are those people?

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:55.900
They're from the western city,

00:05:55.900 --> 00:05:57.700
They aren't Grey Guards.

00:05:57.700 --> 00:06:02.600
No way! The only people who take the Wenn Del path are the Grey Guards!

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:08.200
They capture and kill people who go through.

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:17.050
It's getting cold.

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.650
What a situation.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:26.000
On top of encountering a mugger, we're going to be eaten soon by that Wennbar, or whatever it's called.

00:06:26.000 --> 00:06:28.600
And all we can do is lie here and wait for it...

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:41.450
What?!

00:06:41.450 --> 00:06:43.500
Don't waste it! You're going to spill it.

00:06:47.800 --> 00:06:49.500
Open your mouth wide.

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:51.050
What is this...?

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:56.850
My body... burns.

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:02.370
She gave us... poison!

00:07:08.700 --> 00:07:11.300
What are you... trying to do?

00:07:11.300 --> 00:07:12.750
What are you talking about?

00:07:12.750 --> 00:07:14.850
You can move now, right?

00:07:14.850 --> 00:07:16.400
Lief and Barda.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:19.550
How do you... know our names?

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:22.000
The Grandfather tree told me.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.600
The Grandfather tree?

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:26.700
The Wennbar is coming!

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:28.700
Come on! Climb the tree, hurry!

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:31.300
Come on, hurry up!

00:07:31.600 --> 00:07:34.800
Before that, can you give me back my cloak?

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.800
Nevermind that, just hurry up!

00:07:36.800 --> 00:07:37.950
Do you want to die?

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:42.900
There's no more time, get moving!

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.000
Go!

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:55.500
Keep climbing!

00:07:55.500 --> 00:07:59.750
The Wennbar can't climb trees, but it will try to drag you down with its claws!

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:03.700
Come on, hurry!

00:08:12.300 --> 00:08:13.030
Barda!

00:08:39.950 --> 00:08:40.850
Lief!

00:08:50.700 --> 00:08:52.200
Hold on tight.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:53.900
Is this all we can do?

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:57.100
My hands are going numb from the cold.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:08:59.300
Hey you, my cloak.

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:01.250
It's cold.

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:03.750
Kree.

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:17.600
If we stay under this, we can hide from it.

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:18.700
Come in.

00:09:50.050 --> 00:09:53.400
It's giving up and leaving... Why?

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:56.570
Seems like it couldn't see us all of a sudden.

00:09:57.050 --> 00:09:58.400
Couldn't see us?

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:03.350
<i>This cloak is made with a special fabric.</i>

00:10:03.950 --> 00:10:06.150
I see, it was this cloak!

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:10.550
Why did you decide to save us?

00:10:12.900 --> 00:10:18.000
Because the nice Grandfather tree told me that you're not Guards.

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:20.000
Yes but what does that mean?

00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:22.950
Are you saying that you can talk to trees?

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:25.150
You two can't?

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:29.050
And that cape,

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:32.450
I sensed that your mother had made it with love.

00:10:32.450 --> 00:10:34.100
How do you know that?

00:10:34.100 --> 00:10:37.300
Like I said, the tree told me!

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:40.600
What's wrong?

00:10:44.000 --> 00:10:45.350
The Wenn are coming.

00:10:45.350 --> 00:10:47.270
I can see lots of glowing eyes.

00:10:47.650 --> 00:10:48.700
Wenn?

00:10:50.850 --> 00:10:52.550
The ones that attacked us!

00:11:15.100 --> 00:11:18.210
The Wennbar thought they caught you, right?

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:21.750
The Wenn came to eat what's left.

00:11:38.900 --> 00:11:41.570
I see they're our replacements.

00:11:43.900 --> 00:11:45.400
We're safe now.

00:11:45.400 --> 00:11:48.500
Now that the Wennbar is full, it'll return to its cave.

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.600
It lives in a cave?

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:53.400
Yeah.

00:11:55.200 --> 00:12:01.850
I see. We'll find its cave tomorrow night when it's out hunting.

00:12:01.850 --> 00:12:05.300
The Wennbar's cave is nothing more than a smelly, dirty place.

00:12:05.300 --> 00:12:07.800
What are you two looking for?

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:09.400
That's something we can't say.

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:13.000
But, according to the information we gathered from travellers,

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:18.850
What we're looking for is in the deepest part of the Forest of Silence.

00:12:18.850 --> 00:12:23.100
What's more, it's supposedly protected by a terrifying guard.

00:12:23.100 --> 00:12:26.500
The Wennbar's cave makes perfect sense.

00:12:26.800 --> 00:12:28.050
Huh?

00:12:31.050 --> 00:12:34.550
Knock it off, that's hilarious. Are you guys dumb?

00:12:35.550 --> 00:12:37.700
You two really don't know anything, do you?

00:12:37.700 --> 00:12:40.700
This is just the entrance of the Forest of Silence.

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:45.750
There are plenty of places past here that are more dangerous and unknown.

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:47.200
There's more?

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:48.350
Follow me!

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.450
Hey, wait up!

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.550
How free-spirited she is.

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:08.000
Come in.

00:13:11.000 --> 00:13:12.750
What's all this?

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.900
I stole all of this from the Guards.

00:13:25.250 --> 00:13:26.100
Here.

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:33.300
They're Filli and Kree,

00:13:33.300 --> 00:13:34.850
And I'm Jasmine.

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:37.450
What are you standing around for?

00:13:37.450 --> 00:13:39.450
You'll feel better after you eat.

00:13:41.100 --> 00:13:43.000
Ah, I'll eat then.

00:13:48.800 --> 00:13:50.000
Delicious.

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:54.050
Jasmine, have you always been living here all by yourself?

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:56.800
Yeah. All 16 years of my life.

00:13:57.350 --> 00:14:00.300
16? We're the same age!

00:14:00.300 --> 00:14:02.150
Since when have you been alone?

00:14:05.450 --> 00:14:07.000
Since I was seven.

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.600
I went to get some water from the river.

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:13.650
My parents were looking for food,

00:14:13.650 --> 00:14:16.430
And were trying to bring it to the tree house.

00:14:17.500 --> 00:14:19.850
Then the Guards showed up.

00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:25.460
Why didn't they find you?

00:14:31.150 --> 00:14:36.100
My mum saw me and signaled me to stay hidden.

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:39.650
"Jasmine, be a good girl and stay hidden there."

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:46.350
I believed that if I did what I was told, my parents would come back.

00:14:47.950 --> 00:14:49.000
But,

00:14:49.000 --> 00:14:50.800
They never did.

00:14:50.800 --> 00:14:54.290
I think your mother was trying to protect you.

00:15:00.300 --> 00:15:04.850
Since then, you've always lived by yourself, in this forest?

00:15:04.850 --> 00:15:08.600
The kind-hearted trees and birds helped me.

00:15:09.350 --> 00:15:12.300
Besides, I've learned a lot from my parents.

00:15:12.800 --> 00:15:15.300
I was able to build this house on my own, too.

00:15:15.300 --> 00:15:19.800
Either way, I thank you on the behalf of the people of Deltora.

00:15:19.800 --> 00:15:24.290
Jasmine, thanks to you, we can continue our journey.

00:15:26.500 --> 00:15:31.900
If you're going to the place I'm thinking of, then there was no point in saving you.

00:15:31.900 --> 00:15:34.900
Either way, you won't make it out alive.

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:37.090
What kind of place is that?

00:15:38.100 --> 00:15:39.950
The darkness within darkness.

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:41.400
The darkness within?

00:15:42.100 --> 00:15:45.800
There's a guardian far more terrifying than the Wennbar.

00:15:48.150 --> 00:15:50.200
It isn't full?

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:52.800
It's managed to find this place; this is really bad.

00:15:57.050 --> 00:15:59.200
What are you doing?! Let's get out of here!

00:15:59.200 --> 00:16:01.500
Are you planning on running away forever?

00:16:01.500 --> 00:16:03.950
Are you saying you're going to fight it? The Wennbar?!

00:16:04.300 --> 00:16:08.200
As you can see, I can move my body just fine now.

00:16:09.300 --> 00:16:10.200
Yeah!

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:13.600
N-No, you can't.

00:16:14.300 --> 00:16:15.540
You can't!

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:24.650
Listen. We're going to kill it with one blow from above.

00:16:24.650 --> 00:16:26.650
Do <i>not</i>  get down from the trees.

00:16:32.950 --> 00:16:35.400
Where is it? Where is it coming from?

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:03.100
This is bad.

00:17:11.550 --> 00:17:12.700
What <i>is</i>  this stuff?

00:17:24.800 --> 00:17:27.050
It's finally traced our scent, huh?

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:35.970
Lief! Over here!

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:45.550
Thanks for saving me, Jasmine.

00:17:45.550 --> 00:17:49.000
I'm astonished. You were almost eaten!

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:53.100
Not all trees are kind in this forest.

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:56.900
Trees like that where they try to slip people off are mean trees.

00:17:56.900 --> 00:17:58.000
Slip?

00:17:58.000 --> 00:17:58.800
I've got it!

00:18:01.750 --> 00:18:02.550
Can I borrow this?

00:18:02.550 --> 00:18:03.300
Huh?

00:18:14.350 --> 00:18:15.700
Hey! Over here!

00:18:18.100 --> 00:18:19.320
Now, come!

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:30.150
Lief!!

00:18:37.650 --> 00:18:38.590
Barda!

00:18:45.450 --> 00:18:48.200
Good, there it goes.

00:18:48.200 --> 00:18:50.750
I told you not to leave the trees!

00:18:50.750 --> 00:18:54.450
If Jasmine hadn't come to your rescue, you would have been eaten.

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:55.650
Rescue?

00:18:55.650 --> 00:18:59.950
I just didn't want his cloak to become the Wennbar's dinner.

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:02.950
Choose carefully which trees you walk on.

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:06.650
Trees that catch you are kind trees.

00:19:06.650 --> 00:19:08.650
Kind trees, you say.

00:19:15.150 --> 00:19:16.000
See?

00:19:19.300 --> 00:19:24.000
So the tree that excreted the slippery tree sap and made me fall was a mean tree?

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.450
Exactly.

00:19:25.450 --> 00:19:30.100
The trees that can't get much sunlight have distorted personalities.

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:36.550
The path ahead is awfully dark.

00:19:36.550 --> 00:19:38.450
The darkness within darkness.

00:19:38.450 --> 00:19:42.500
It's more than just distorted.

00:19:42.500 --> 00:19:45.700
It's a far more frightening and evil place.

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:48.050
Kree is cautious of it.

00:19:48.050 --> 00:19:49.150
That much?

00:19:49.800 --> 00:19:51.750
There's a terrifying guardian.

00:19:51.750 --> 00:19:55.500
Once you step foot in there, you're never coming back.

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:57.200
I see.

00:19:57.200 --> 00:19:59.610
We've reached the place of our objective.

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:13.400
What is it?

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:15.950
The trees are telling us to go back.

00:20:15.950 --> 00:20:19.350
They say that it's reckless to continue further.

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:22.100
Inside there is the darkness within darkness.

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:24.600
The centre of it is...

00:20:26.150 --> 00:20:27.650
Alright, let's head down.

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:30.200
I can't go.

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:34.500
I can't let these two live a life alone like I am now.

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:37.350
I understand.

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:38.350
Indeed.

00:20:38.350 --> 00:20:40.900
From here it'll be fine with just the two of us.

00:20:40.900 --> 00:20:43.020
Thanks for everything, and the cloak.

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:47.450
I know it's very important to you.

00:20:48.400 --> 00:20:49.250
See you.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:12.600
What is it?

00:21:12.600 --> 00:21:13.500
The belt.

00:21:15.500 --> 00:21:18.600
The belt's metal is warming up.

00:21:18.600 --> 00:21:20.650
What in the world is going on?

00:21:20.650 --> 00:21:24.180
I'm not sure, but the belt is sensing something!

00:21:25.250 --> 00:21:28.650
It may be a sign that one of the gems is nearby.

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:32.600
As well as the guardian that everyone's so afraid of.

00:21:33.750 --> 00:21:36.000
The guardian everyone's afraid of...

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:38.750
What is it?

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:39.650
Nothing.

00:21:39.650 --> 00:21:43.400
Lief. Aren't you regretting this journey?

00:21:43.400 --> 00:21:45.400
H-How could I be?

00:21:45.800 --> 00:21:47.050
Don't overdo it.

00:21:47.050 --> 00:21:48.650
What do you mean by that?

00:21:48.650 --> 00:21:51.350
Scary things are scary. That's fine.

00:21:51.350 --> 00:21:52.700
I'm not scared!

00:21:53.250 --> 00:21:54.700
You're a stubborn one.

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:56.450
Then!

00:21:56.450 --> 00:22:00.600
With your sword, cut down all enemies that come your way!

00:22:03.500 --> 00:22:04.600
Shall we go?

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:07.250
Of course!

00:22:13.050 --> 00:22:15.300
The belt is warmer than earlier.

00:22:15.300 --> 00:22:16.550
Alright!

00:22:16.550 --> 00:22:18.550
Now we'll just follow the belt!

00:22:35.550 --> 00:22:41.050
Cherry blossom flowers are fluttering down
Sakura maiochite yuku

00:22:41.320 --> 00:22:46.720
As if they were peeled from the sky
Sora kara hagareru you ni

00:22:47.600 --> 00:22:52.680
I'm gripping and holding hard
Anata to ita omoide ha

00:22:52.980 --> 00:22:58.450
The memories I have with you
Zutto gyutto dakishimeteru kara

00:22:59.920 --> 00:23:05.750
All of a sudden, flower petals are in full bloom
Futto maue ni ukabu no ha

00:23:06.230 --> 00:23:09.350
They're floating right above me
Mankai no hanabira

00:23:11.840 --> 00:23:17.130
No matter how long I wait, no one is coming
Mattetatte mou daremo konai

00:23:17.340 --> 00:23:24.100
Have I really left my wavering feelings behind?
Yureru omoi ha oitekitandeshou

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:32.340
I'm all alone right here, singing a song about cherry blossoms
Sakura uta utai nagara

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:38.280
Just waiting for no one else but you
Anata wo matsu watashi ha hitori

00:23:38.600 --> 00:23:44.290
This love has taught something to me:
Kono koi ga oshiete kureta

00:23:44.690 --> 00:23:50.600
That true love is hidden on ordinary days
Heibon na hibi koso ai to

00:23:50.600 --> 00:23:58.810
I present my last song to the spring breeze
Harukaze ni saigo no uta wo

00:24:06.640 --> 00:24:07.800
Wennbar.

00:24:08.590 --> 00:24:11.120
A monster that lives in the Forest of Silence.

00:24:11.120 --> 00:24:17.360
Able to extend and retract its neck freely, it uses its neck to prey on tree fruits and birds in flight.

00:24:17.360 --> 00:24:19.680
It's said that it can live for up to 100 years.

00:24:20.200 --> 00:24:23.980
We found the first gem and began our fight with its guardian.

00:24:23.980 --> 00:24:28.580
While the enemy may be strong, I'm sure that we can defeat him if the three of us combine our strength.

00:24:28.580 --> 00:24:30.900
However, even though our journey has just begun, Barda is...

00:24:30.900 --> 00:24:31.920
The Golden Knight, Gorl

00:24:31.920 --> 00:24:34.600
Next time, 'The Golden Knight, Gorl'!
The Golden Knight, Gorl
